# FosOS: load KMS before Plymouth so the logo+spinner theme can use DRM.
# Debian trixie kernels ship without CONFIG_DRM_SIMPLEDRM, and plymouth
# 24.x here has no plymouth.use-simpledrm — waiting on a late GPU probe
# falls back to the grey three-dot text theme. Modules listed here are
# forced into /conf/modules and loaded before init-premount/plymouth.
# Missing hardware simply fails modprobe; that is fine.
drm
i915 modeset=1
amdgpu
radeon
nouveau
hyperv_drm
